{"ID":"20231122101054-g08ko1j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20231122101054-g08ko1j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122101054-g08ko1j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122101114-i4gpinm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122101309-womrum5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1059,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231122101309-womrum5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:53\u0026#125;","title":"太阴阳明论","type":"doc","updated":"20231122143733"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231122101114-i4gpinm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101114-i4gpinm","updated":"20231122101114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本篇要点："}]},{"ID":"20231122101114-3yhc29n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101114-3yhc29n","updated":"20231122101405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​一：论述了太阴、阳明表里两经在阴阳异位、虚实逆从等方面的不同变化，进而推至三阴三阳六经极其所属脏腑的发病规律；外感六淫之邪则阳受而多病在六腑，饮食起居不节则阴受之多病在五脏。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101114-ddigili","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101114-ddigili","updated":"20231122101407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二：脾不主时，是因其属土，位居中央，分旺于四时以长四脏。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101114-0bcmdw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101114-0bcmdw0","updated":"20231122101408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三：脾主四肢，是由于脾为胃行其津液以濡养四肢，脏腑亦各因脾经而受气于阳明，脾病则四肢不用。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101120-9m12jij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101120-9m12jij"}},{"ID":"20231122101309-jdgcys5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-jdgcys5","updated":"20231122101926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问曰：太阴阳明为表里，脾胃脉也。生病而异者何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-e8nq1yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-e8nq1yh","updated":"20231122101317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝问道：太阴、阳明两经，互为表里，是脾胃所属的经脉，而所生的疾病不同，是什麽道理？"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-ne69ksd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-ne69ksd","updated":"20231122101928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯对曰：阴阳异位，更虚更实，更逆更从，或从内或从外，所从不同，故病异名也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-m0zkgdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-m0zkgdn","updated":"20231122101321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯回答说：太阴属阴经，阳明属阳经，两经循行的部位不同，四时的虚实顺逆不同，病或从内生，或从外入，发病原因也有差异，所以病名也就不同。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-57qavnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-57qavnc","updated":"20231122101932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：愿闻其异状也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-13uts5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-13uts5e","updated":"20231122101328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：我想知道它们不同的情况。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-1sacp33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-1sacp33","updated":"20231122101935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：阳者天气也，主外；阴者地气也，主内。故阳道实，阴道虚。故犯贼风虚邪者阳受之，食饮不节，起居不时者，阴受之。阳受之则入六腑，阴受之则入五脏。入六腑则身热不时卧，上为喘呼；入五脏则瞋满闭塞，下为飧泄，久为肠澼。故喉主天气，咽主地气。故阳受风气，阴受湿气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-op9fow9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-op9fow9","updated":"20231122101330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：人身的阳气，犹如天气，主卫互于外；阴气，犹如地气，主营养于内。所以阳气性刚多实，阴气性柔易虚。凡是贼风虚邪伤人，外表阳气先受侵害；饮食起居失调，内在阴气先受损伤。阳分受邪，往往传入六腑；阴气受病，每多累及五脏。邪入六腑，可见发热不得安卧，气上逆而喘促；邪入五脏，则见脘腹胀满，闭塞不通，在下为大便泄泻，病久而产生痢疾。所以喉司呼吸而通天气，咽吞饮食而连地气。因此阳经易受风邪，阴经易感湿邪。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-jd4kjnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-jd4kjnx","updated":"20231122101938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"故阴气从足上行至头，而下行循臂至指端；阳气从手上行至头，而下行至足。故曰阳病者上行极而下，阴病者下行极而上。故伤于风者上先受之，伤于湿者，下先受之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-wt21k3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-wt21k3v","updated":"20231122101332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足三阴经脉之气，从足上行至头，再向下沿臂膊到达指端；手足三阳静脉之气，从手上行至头，再向下行到足。所以说，阳经的病邪，先上行至极点，再向下行；阴经的病邪，先下行至极点，再向上行。故风邪为病，上部首先感受；湿邪成疾，下部首先侵害。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-3662we3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-3662we3","updated":"20231122101954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：脾病而四肢不用何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-wabpqs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-wabpqs6","updated":"20231122142959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：脾主四肢，脾病会引起四肢功能丧失，这是什麽道理？"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-bfyrjyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-bfyrjyr","updated":"20231122101956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：四肢皆禀气于胃而不得至经，必因于脾乃得禀也。今脾病不能为胃行其津液，四肢不得禀水谷气，气日以衰，脉道不利，筋骨肌内，皆无气以生，故不用焉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-6wi7q3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-6wi7q3z","updated":"20231122143138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：四肢都要承受小肠中水谷精气以濡养，但小肠中精气不能直接到达四肢经脉，必须依赖脾气的传输，才能营养四肢。如今脾有病不能为胃输送水谷精气，四肢失去营养，则经气日渐衰减，经脉不能畅通，筋骨肌肉都得不到濡养，因此四肢便丧失正常的功能了。"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-ogj9pdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-ogj9pdt","updated":"20231122101958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：脾不主时何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-gxtlr9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-gxtlr9y","updated":"20231122143344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：脾脏不能主旺一个时季，是什麽道理？（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾脏没有主春夏秋冬，是什么道理？这里就是长夏季的由来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-x5dhema","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-x5dhema","updated":"20231122102000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：脾者土也。治中央，常以四时长四脏，各十八日寄治，不得独主于时也。脾脏者常着胃土之精也。土者生万物而法天地，故上下至头足不得主时也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-kd2eith","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-kd2eith","updated":"20231122143733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：脾在五行中属土，主管中央之位，分旺于四时以长养四脏，在四季之末各寄旺十八日，故脾不单独主旺于一个时季。由于脾脏经常为胃土传输水谷精气，譬如天地养育万物一样无时或缺的。所以它能从上到下，从头到足，输送水谷之精于全身各部分，而不专主旺于一时季。（脾不主旺一个时季，但季节转换的过程都会经过长夏季即脾；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"内经里，是以18天作为一个节气即长夏季长度是18天；而在算命中，是以2周即14天作为一个节气；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"）"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-vleghu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-vleghu1","updated":"20231122102002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"帝曰：脾与胃以膜相连耳，而能为之行其津液何也？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-ngc01dk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-ngc01dk","updated":"20231122101342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄帝道：脾与胃仅以一膜相连，而脾能为胃转输津液，这是什麽道理？"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-x9wzjk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-x9wzjk1","updated":"20231122102006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯曰：足太阴者三阴也，其脉贯胃，属脾，络溢，故太阴为之行气于三阴。阳明者表也，五脏六腑之海也，亦为之行气于三阳。脏腑各因其经而受气于阳明，故为胃行其津液。四肢不得禀水谷气，日以益衰，阴道不利，筋骨肌肉，无气以生，故不用焉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20231122101309-womrum5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231122101309-womrum5","updated":"20231122101345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"岐伯说：足太阴脾经，属三阴，它的经脉贯通到胃，连属于脾，环绕咽喉，故脾能把胃中水谷之精气输送到手足三阴经；足阳明胃经，为脾经之表，是供给五脏六腑营养之处，故胃也能将太阴之气输送到手足三阳经。五脏六腑各通过脾经以接受胃中的精气，所以说脾能为胃运行津液。如四肢得不到水谷经气的滋养，经气便日趋衰减，脉道不通，筋骨肌肉都失却营养，因而也就丧失正常的功用了。"}]}]}